  rigSignature: 415899A36E5F36473438AE1BC4FE6EC914F96F9E5C882A7651388F4C7C395EF5
  description: 'Stand upright at frame 0 and hold through frame 30. Gradually shift
    weight toward the right wall. Open the right armpit only slightly and place the
    outside of the right upper arm, from shoulder to elbow, against the wall. Keep
    the right elbow low with only a gentle bend; the forearm and hand hang naturally
    rather than folding upward. Keep the left upper arm resting closely against the
    side of the torso and hanging down parallel to it. Do not lift or spread the
    left arm sideways. Angle the relaxed arm only slightly toward the back while
    keeping it outside the torso. Soften the left knee and lift the left heel while
    the toes stay planted. Reach the supported Loop pose at frame 120. 60 fps, authored
    keys every 30 frames; match Loop frame 0 exactly. Refinement: the right leg is
    the nearly straight weight-bearing support (about 6 degrees of knee flexion)
    throughout the supported lean. Both feet keep their authored contact positions;
    the relaxed left knee and raised heel are retained.'
  sourceRig: {fileID: 1648686333044378150, guid: 9d1a15a96145a924e838aae19388632a, type: 3}
